  "description": [
    "Sums, differences and products of doubles are IEEE's: 18 pairs, 12 of them random, give Python's results bit for bit, folded at compile time or computed (`double-ieee-ops`, `double-fold-*`).",
    "`inf - inf`, `inf * 0` and `inf / inf` are NaN; `1e308 * 10` is `inf`. Nothing raises."
  ],
